<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces now hold the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have seized Buurhakaba and another town in the Bay region, extending fighting in southern Somalia. Al Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six civilians, and the ICRC treated 148 wounded after heavy combat in Baidoa. Ethiopia has withdrawn more than 3,000 troops and will not intervene in the South West State conflict, and a UAE drone strike in Puntland killed four family members, including a pregnant teenager. The US and UAE also carried out airstrikes against al-Shabaab in northern Somalia. 2,284 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOQjVlUUZjek4xcXZhdFZNM3V4czJ3eEhwYkk3d3cyc1ZQQ3U4UzY1c2NQSUNSLVVGNGFoeGs2a0JOdnpGMWljVHNETnEyUzF1Tk5faGJJRmZGWmx2NXlWQjZaeUpHdEg5Vlppd3NmaVFBWEFsbVZadllkOTZLSkdtT0Jrang?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNY3B6Z0JTNGhFbzNCanhMNVh4bTVsMFpWWU5VenFYYmdyR2NXenNiZkt1S1dKaFZDYWVVdTlwOVpsWDR3UmpHYVdMQU40elJwcmZ2ZXpaOGhNT2FXUnpScWRvZGI1VGZiN0JrWFQ4LUF5NWZnYndJWm9fN2FieEdJbm56ekZVcmhUaktIcUFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPRldQY1N6YUM5ZXZGQkUwQmd1NFAzMFVjSEZkanJ6Y2ItZTFZLUVtN0E3R0Z4dkpwX0J5WVZfNlRIT0ZxTlZhSm5KOVpzczJPYjZHYktpYUx5aTF5QjdlWGF2RGEteTdtb1ZuNDNnQ20zUnVZbEZPeHRfbTZJTDkwbnhScm9KZ1JvQW5lXzhoc3lJNFYwTEtPWTJiMlZmdmhPZTJDOHNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOcU1zWHJuYmlBemJDenprV3lnbWhkTGQ4WkpTRmRwZ0VCaGlKNkNBOEw1b29CeEFZSmZRS0xwOGVxZkF1OEw2aDlLWms2a21ZMU4td1JBMzlvM2VTR1Z6S09RS0t2c1VEVG82XzFvZTl5OWdHV